  "translatedBlocks": 148,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "82c5966abc9d9e6d",
      "translationZh": "简而言之——Falcon Perception 是一个拥有 0.6B 参数的早期融合 Transformer，可根据自然语言提示进行开放词汇定位与分割。该模型使用混合注意力掩码，在同一个序列中处理图像块与文本，并通过一个小型、结构化的词元接口和轻量级输出头，生成数量可变的实例。在 SA-Co 上，Falcon Perception 的 Macro-F1 达到 68.0（SAM 3 为 62.3），目前主要的差距在于存在性校准（MCC 为 0.64，而 SAM 3 为 0.82）。我们还推出了 PBench，这是一个诊断性基准，可按能力（属性、OCR 引导的消歧、空间约束、关系）以及密集长上下文拥挤场景细分评估性能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c215178de5cc2df2",
      "translationZh": "我们还发布了 Falcon OCR，这是一个拥有 0.3B 参数的模型，在 olmOCR 基准和 OmniDocBench 上分别获得 80.3 和 88.6 的分数，同时其吞吐量在所有开源 OCR 模型中最高。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "71aa8f776722ef7c",
      "translationZh": "本文是一篇简短、务实的介绍，讲述我们构建了什么、为什么采用这种构建方式，以及在此过程中学到了什么。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "67e64e85442314ac",
      "translationZh": "问题：为什么感知系统最终会变成流水线？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a3bd090efcfc0b48",
      "translationZh": "许多开放词汇感知系统采用模块化流水线构建：由一个（通常被冻结的）视觉骨干网络提取特征，再由独立的融合／解码器阶段将这些特征与语言结合，另外还有组件负责匹配和后处理。这类设计在许多场景下表现良好，但也存在取舍：它可能难以简洁地扩展，难以将改进归因于正确的组件，而且当我们针对每一种失效模式添加新的修补措施时，很容易不断累积复杂性。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3f4d867ddc57f108",
      "translationZh": "我们提出了一个更简单的问题：如果选择合适的注意力模式、输出接口和训练信号，单个早期融合 Transformer 骨干网络能否同时处理感知和语言建模？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "09d564e36ff3a5d5",
      "translationZh": "在我们的实验中，答案基本上是肯定的。本文其余部分将介绍主要的设计选择及其背后的证据。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "02afeadea88ad8eb",
      "translationZh": "架构：早期融合、混合注意力与高效的密集输出接口",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "078cbb46af60d046",
      "translationZh": "单个自回归 Transformer 处理由图像块、文本和任务词元组成的统一序列。模型按固定顺序预测对象属性：<coord> → <size> → <seg>。边界框的坐标和尺寸通过专用头解码，并以傅里叶特征的形式重新注入。高分辨率分割掩码通过 <seg> 词元与上采样后的图像特征之间的点积生成。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "928f7af3253f2cdf",
      "translationZh": "一个骨干网络，两种行为",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d842f31010983354",
      "translationZh": "Falcon Perception 的核心是一个稠密 Transformer，从第一层开始就在共享参数空间中处理图像块和文本词元。我们没有采用独立的视觉骨干网络后接晚期融合解码器的方式，而是保留单个骨干网络，依靠掩码机制和轻量级输出接口，让稠密预测问题变得易于处理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "586828588e1143db",
      "translationZh": "图像和文本具有不同的结构：像素是二维的，能够受益于双向上下文，而预测接口天然具有序列性。我们通过混合注意力掩码来解决这一问题：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "826d9abbda31fe8d",
      "translationZh": "图像词元以双向方式关注所有其他图像词元，构建全局视觉上下文（就像视觉编码器所做的那样）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9da272a666641dac",
      "translationZh": "文本和任务词元以因果方式关注它们之前的所有内容——完整的视觉前缀以及前面的文本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dce732095f6dad38",
      "translationZh": "这使同一个骨干网络在处理图像词元时能够像双向视觉编码器一样工作，同时仍支持对任务词元进行自回归预测。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e9f28dc740325a1d",
      "translationZh": "感知链：面向稠密输出的由粗到细监督",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b6f23157b36b0432",
      "translationZh": "密集感知并不是一个固定大小的预测问题：一张图像中可能没有任何实例，也可能包含数百个实例。自回归生成提供了简洁的可变长度接口，但完全自回归的密集生成（例如逐个 token 生成多边形或高分辨率掩码）很快就会变得代价高昂。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5a218f2a6436bfd3",
      "translationZh": "我们使用一个小型结构化接口 Chain-of-Perception，将每个实例分解为三个步骤：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5ec8e1ab45ceeae2",
      "translationZh": "坐标 token：模型首先预测实例的中心——确定它所指的是哪个对象。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "526cff580d497fc5",
      "translationZh": "尺寸 token：然后预测空间范围——确定它有多大。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a9a3195384e8d67e",
      "translationZh": "分割 token：最后生成一个嵌入向量，将其与上采样后的图像特征做点积，即可得到全分辨率的二值掩码。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b25851436a6daa22",
      "translationZh": "这样的顺序是刻意设计的。首先确定几何信息可以减少歧义（“是哪个实例？”），并使掩码预测步骤更接近于以已确定的对象为条件进行像素细化。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "bceb6091c89849cd",
      "translationZh": "专用输出头，极低开销",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f36c7d0d21702373",
      "translationZh": "骨干网络是共享的，而解码则使用针对输出类型定制的轻量级输出头：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9a1c87908ed3e891",
      "translationZh": "坐标与尺寸预测头使用傅里叶特征编码：通过随机高斯投影，将连续坐标映射到高维正弦空间。这克服了神经网络的频谱偏置，实现了比仅采用离散分箱更精确的定位。解码后的坐标会被重新注入序列，作为后续 token 的条件信息。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8fb727e5a1ab06e8",
      "translationZh": "分割头计算 <seg> token 的隐藏状态与经过内容感知上采样的图像特征之间的点积。由于 <seg> token 在几何信息之后生成，并且能够访问早期融合的视觉上下文，我们可以避免使用基于解码器的实例分割训练中经常出现的独立掩码查询机制和匈牙利匹配。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "af921c845d074500",
      "translationZh": "PBench：旨在单独识别能力缺口的基准",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "71c782d758a3b8bd",
      "translationZh": "RefCOCO 等现有的指代表达基准已趋于饱和——模型的得分经常达到 90%+——而且它们将不同的出错原因混为一谈。模型失败，是因为无法读取文字？无法理解空间关系？还是无法应对人群场景？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7c4c85f901518af7",
      "translationZh": "我们推出了 PBench，这是一个诊断性基准，按照样本所需的主要能力对其进行分类：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1709305c9fa966d1",
      "translationZh": "级别",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5faf58a69db59058",
      "translationZh": "能力",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c2d8970b1901951a",
      "translationZh": "提示词示例",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "56db6aa48d74e522",
      "translationZh": "简单物体",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "df4fea0f3b7fc33a",
      "translationZh": "\"汽车\"",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "48d773621f2b1b94",
      "translationZh": "属性与子类型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e96413c5104c80b7",
      "translationZh": "\"红色汽车\", \"破损的围栏\"",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2456ef2c23089555",
      "translationZh": "OCR 引导的识别",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a39526f8a24730af",
      "translationZh": "“Diet Coke 瓶子”、“Nike 鞋”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "68426af17a992c1a",
      "translationZh": "空间理解",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e6716eea66208bf1",
      "translationZh": "“左边的汽车”、“从左往右第三扇窗户”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1ef4735a668d87ac",
      "translationZh": "关系与交互",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "69cf1c7c3c2807b9",
      "translationZh": "“撑着伞的人”、“最高的建筑”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0710262cd7babfc2",
      "translationZh": "密集",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "383e6a2597b1c231",
      "translationZh": "密集程度压力测试",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "56cf3c78ee216d88",
      "translationZh": "每张图像包含数百个实例",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1a9574e2b3a2af3d",
      "translationZh": "每个样本都针对一项主要能力：OCR 提示避免使用空间限定词，空间提示则避免使用图像内的文字来消除歧义。这样得到的是一份能力概况，而非一个不透明的单一分数，也更容易据此决定下一步应在哪些方面投入（数据、训练课程或后训练）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "6def6fa331a98921",
      "translationZh": "训练：蒸馏、大规模数据与三阶段方案",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "fa8897b0dc06251b",
      "translationZh": "多教师蒸馏",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1f5f4d0f5482970d",
      "translationZh": "Falcon Perception 并非从随机权重开始训练（在我们的消融实验中，这种方式在分割任务上表现不稳定），而是通过多教师蒸馏进行初始化。两个强大的视觉教师模型提供了互补的信号：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "edb56f23c9bb08fd",
      "translationZh": "DINOv3 (ViT-H)：提供对分割至关重要的强大局部特征",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "586ba9c0e3ed6e48",
      "translationZh": "SigLIP2：提供用于开放词汇理解的语言对齐特征",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a83004e6b0809703",
      "translationZh": "蒸馏得到的初始化在 ImageNet-1k 上实现了 74.25% 的零样本准确率，在 Pascal VOC 上实现了 85.11% 的线性探测 mIoU，为感知专项训练提供了坚实的视觉基础。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f33eacdc177ab34c",
      "translationZh": "数据：54M 张图像、195M 条正样本表达、488M 个困难负样本",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4c30379ca8b2bc8b",
      "translationZh": "我们通过一个多阶段流水线构建训练集：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "421a8b63d4b6c66b",
      "translationZh": "利用 DINOv3 嵌入对从网络抓取的图像进行层次聚类，以确保概念覆盖均匀。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "51dc39c3306e7ba8",
      "translationZh": "由 VLM 驱动的列举过程为每张图像生成密集的对象描述，并按 PBench 复杂度级别分类（60% 为基础级，40% 为高级）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "041115b070644a1a",
      "translationZh": "负样本挖掘生成语义、视觉和细粒度困难负样本，以抑制幻觉。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "648988c0efa500c4",
      "translationZh": "集成共识——SAM 3、Qwen3-VL-30B 和 Moondream3 必须达成一致（IoU > 0.8），才能自动接受。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5d2643b1c74742d1",
      "translationZh": "人工核验——存在分歧的样本交由标注人员处理，从而找回那些令自动化系统困惑的困难样本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "87ccaae8ae71ee91",
      "translationZh": "我们严格保持正负样本 1:1 的比例。这使得存在性校准成为一项核心目标：模型应当能够可靠地判断“不存在”，而不只是在有把握时绘制掩码。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e9568069c9f4c214",
      "translationZh": "三个阶段（总计 700 GT）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "df7242c3804de76b",
      "translationZh": "阶段 1——上下文内列举（450 GT）：模型学习以自回归方式列举场景中的物体清单——预测文本表达及其位置。查询之间采用完整的因果注意力，使模型能够学习物体的共现关系（“先是叉子，然后是刀，再然后是盘子”）。这有助于建立广泛的场景理解能力。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b7707aa71d8b560a",
      "translationZh": "阶段 2——任务对齐（225 GT）：修改注意力掩码，使查询不再能看到彼此，从而模拟推理时的独立查询。屏蔽文本 token 上的损失，将梯度信号完全集中于存在性分类和定位。这一阶段实现了从“理解场景”到“回答这个具体问题”的转变。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "348ee8bf961ff92d",
      "translationZh": "阶段 3——长上下文微调（10 GT）：这是一个简短的阶段，将每个表达对应的掩码数量上限提高至 600，并采用极小的恒定学习率。这使模型能够适应极高的人群密度，同时不遗忘先前的能力。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c9666b656075dc58",
      "translationZh": "通过消融实验验证的关键设计选择：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5a86c6c1a298bc1a",
      "translationZh": "为专用头使用 Muon 优化器（相较于 AdamW）——在 SA-Co 检测上提升 4.8 分",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b2ad6ce393a20874",
      "translationZh": "按光栅顺序排列实例（相较于随机排序或按大小排序）——在 SA-Co 上比随机排序高 10 分",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "39f21725cf2f737c",
      "translationZh": "Gram 特征正则化——防止特征偏离蒸馏特征，使分割表现提升 +1.5 分",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b876d5a56202886d",
      "translationZh": "跨 rank 的全局损失归一化——纠正 FSDP 中变长打包序列带来的偏差",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "219c4a6c86a716e9",
      "translationZh": "结果",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "66eba80c9d43c355",
      "translationZh": "SA-Co：同类最佳的掩码质量",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "80a1e3d39ff48986",
      "translationZh": "在 SA-Co 开放词汇分割基准上，Falcon Perception（0.6B 参数）的 Macro-F1 达到 68.0，而 SAM 3 为 62.3；在属性密集型（+8.2）、食品与饮料（+12.2）以及运动器材（+4.0）子集上均有大幅提升。与此同时，Falcon Perception 在存在性校准方面落后于 SAM 3（MCC：0.64 对 0.82），这是目前最明确的待改进方向。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "42e2ad6f8fec85a7",
      "translationZh": "下面是一个输出示例——提示词“Falcon”生成了精确的实例掩码：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9cc59becc4a1f18a",
      "translationZh": "Falcon Perception 在指代表达方面也表现出色，能够在视频的每一帧中正确分割出黑色面包的汉堡：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "0b7dd1d92fdb9c18",
      "translationZh": "PBench：随提示复杂度扩展",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e43337478e3cc290",
      "translationZh": "早期融合设计在这里体现出了最大的差异：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5faf58a69db59058",
      "translationZh": "能力",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "37e3ec26fd442108",
      "translationZh": "Falcon 感知",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cb129306bc6fd098",
      "translationZh": "差距",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c927952e32dd193d",
      "translationZh": "L0：简单对象",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0090",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e9d034cbc735ba38",
      "translationZh": "L1：属性",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0094",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6406377fc4ccf78b",
      "translationZh": "L2：OCR 引导",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0098",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fc9cb7dfcab331d1",
      "translationZh": "L3：空间",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0102",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aee60ea073f149ec",
      "translationZh": "L4：关系",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0106",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0710262cd7babfc2",
      "translationZh": "密集",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0110",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ef9280b3dfaccd4f",
      "translationZh": "对于简单物体，差距不大。随着提示变得更具组合性——需要 OCR 引导的消歧、空间约束或关系绑定——差距随之扩大。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0111",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d0b0e2a351149477",
      "translationZh": "在我们的 PBench 密集子集中，Falcon Perception（0.6B）的表现显著优于通用 VLM 基线（例如，在我们的评估设置下，其得分为 72.6，而 Qwen3-VL-30B 为 8.9），并且在空间和关系层级上达到或超过了 8B 模型的表现。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0112",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "5083241a9546181e",
      "translationZh": "定性结果：OCR、空间、关系与密集场景",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0113",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "59cae6134ea792a9",
      "translationZh": "随着提示变得更具组合性——需要 OCR 引导的消歧、空间约束、关系绑定，或扩展至数百个实例——早期融合的优势变得直观可见：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0114",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "070d5d54dc71df9e",
      "translationZh": "OCR 引导的定位（第 2 级）：当用于区分物体的线索是写在物体上的文字时，Falcon Perception 能够正确识读，而 SAM 3 则无法加以区分。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0115",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "746eb19e941ff2bd",
      "translationZh": "空间理解（第 3 级）：当提示词指定空间关系时，Falcon Perception 会构建连贯的二维场景地图。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0116",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "12f1a9b5ec6378f4",
      "translationZh": "关系推理（第 4 级）：当目标是通过交互而非外观来定义时，Falcon Perception 能够理解场景图。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0117",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8e0c8cb5136af030",
      "translationZh": "密集场景：扩展至数百个实例：当场景极为拥挤、固定查询解码器可能触及实际限制时，自回归接口尤其有用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0118",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1e60b0e2e6091eea",
      "translationZh": "第 2 级——OCR 引导的定位：Falcon Perception 通过读取物体上的文字来消除歧义；SAM 3 则无法做到。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0119",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eee60ee1c7c8827e",
      "translationZh": "“168 葡萄酒瓶”：Falcon Perception 会识别标有“168”的瓶子，而 SAM 3 会高亮显示所有瓶子。“檀香山方向指示牌”：Falcon 会读取文字，找到正确的指示牌。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0120",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1ad371efc2f5dd14",
      "translationZh": "第 3 级——空间理解：Falcon Perception 能够解析空间约束；SAM 3 则会返回误报。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0121",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0ef21a6b5b0ca59d",
      "translationZh": "“左侧烤架上较下方的肉串”、“底部红色汽车右侧的黑色汽车”、“左侧的比利时国旗”——Falcon Perception 能够根据空间约束确定正确的实例。SAM 3 则会将多个候选对象误判为目标。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0122",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3034915bb2ea002d",
      "translationZh": "第 4 级——关系推理：Falcon Perception 能够理解交互；SAM 3 则会忽略关系约束。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0123",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "40a54b563afd98e4",
      "translationZh": "“棕色圆面包旁边的酥点”、“正在使用手机的人”、“手里拿着头盔的人”——Falcon Perception 能识别出参与交互的具体实例。SAM 3 则会高亮显示该对象类别的所有实例，忽略关系约束。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0124",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "57a39cff03666dba",
      "translationZh": "密集场景：Falcon Perception 可扩展至处理数百个实例；SAM 3 的解码器则会耗尽查询词元。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0125",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9409a70f5e36d543",
      "translationZh": "“雪雁”、“鸽子”、“色彩缤纷的罐装饮料”——Falcon Perception 以自回归方式分割数百个实例。SAM 3 的固定大小解码器在实例数量超过约 200 个时就会耗尽查询词元。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0126",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "5b9e1323371b5ff9",
      "translationZh": "Falcon OCR：将早期融合扩展至文档理解",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0127",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ac0ab69f125c3d8a",
      "translationZh": "现代 OCR 早已不再局限于从清晰的扫描件中提取文本。如今的系统必须在一次处理中应对多栏布局、数学公式、表格、图表和多语言内容。大多数具有竞争力的 OCR VLM 都采用一种常见方案：由视觉编码器向独立的文本解码器提供输入，再配以针对特定任务的衔接机制。这些系统能够奏效，但规模往往较大（1B–3B+ 参数）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0128",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "08ba56b71b70f3a4",
      "translationZh": "我们选择了另一条路径：复用 Falcon Perception 中相同的早期融合稠密 Transformer，但专门针对 OCR，从头训练一个更小的 0.3B 参数变体。由此得到的便是 Falcon OCR——它以单一骨干网络，在共享参数空间中处理图像块和文本词元，采用相同的混合注意力掩码（图像词元使用双向注意力，文本词元使用因果注意力），并通过提示而非附加模块来切换任务。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0129",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "29c1f9fcf45de126",
      "translationZh": "我们选择从头训练（不使用多教师蒸馏），是因为 OCR 所需的视觉特征——细粒度字形识别、笔画级辨别——与有助于分割的对象级特征存在显著差异。从零开始能让骨干网络从基础阶段就发展出针对文本优化的表征。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0130",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "36a798e3f39239cc",
      "translationZh": "训练",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0131",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3ca7047e4ffb9bcb",
      "translationZh": "我们使用经过精心筛选的英语混合数据进行训练，涵盖三项核心任务：通用文档文本解析（数字 PDF、旧扫描件、打字文档）、数学与科学公式识别，以及表格结构识别。混合数据还包括手写文本、真实场景文本，以及通过渲染 LaTeX 和 HTML 源文件生成的合成样本。训练目标纯粹是对结构化文本输出进行下一个词元预测。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0132",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fcfaa844815c5113",
      "translationZh": "训练分为两个阶段：首先是较长的预训练阶段，学习率保持恒定，模型在此期间学习涵盖所有元素类型的核心 OCR 能力；随后是较短的余弦衰减微调阶段，学习率逐步退火至接近零。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0133",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c7d20824eaa3a66e",
      "translationZh": "基准测试结果",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0134",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "087e01310dceb24e",
      "translationZh": "我们在 olmOCR（针对多样化输入进行二元正确性检查）和 OmniDocBench（针对整页解析结果计算连续型指标）上进行评估。所有对比模型的规模都显著更大，和/或使用专有基础设施。Falcon OCR 仅有 0.3B 参数，在 olmOCR 上达到 80.3%，与排名第一的系统仅相差 1.7 个百分点，并在多栏（87.1%）和表格（90.3%）类别中领先所有模型。在 OmniDocBench 上，其总体得分为 88.64，高于 DeepSeek OCR v2、GPT 5.2 和 Mistral OCR 3。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0135",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "6f062ea025a27020",
      "translationZh": "推理服务吞吐量",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0136",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "45d50b83d38358b1",
      "translationZh": "Falcon OCR 的参数量为 0.3B，约为 0.9B 级 OCR VLM 参数量的三分之一，这直接带来了更高的推理服务吞吐量。在单张 A100-80GB 上使用 vLLM，在高并发条件下测得：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0137",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5e23ec6a300dc60a",
      "translationZh": "模式",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0140",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "526e0087cc3f254d",
      "translationZh": "描述",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0141",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9c4563d047c370c5",
      "translationZh": "版面分析 + OCR",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0144",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "374bbdccc49e7ea3",
      "translationZh": "完整流程：版面检测 → 裁剪 → 逐区域 OCR",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0145",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "03ca03c17e16f3cb",
      "translationZh": "较小的资源占用以及与 vLLM 的集成（连续批处理、PagedAttention、优化的 CUDA 内核），使其能够切实用于需要处理数百万页的大规模文档数字化场景。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0146",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "286ce5385861f557",
      "translationZh": "我们从结果中看到了什么",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0147",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2c0d9ff59f8be2f7",
      "translationZh": "更广泛地说，这些结果表明，早期融合的单栈 Transformer 是 OCR 中“视觉编码器加文本解码器”方案的一种可行替代方案。一个骨干网络、共享的参数空间、一个解码接口，以及更好的数据和训练信号，而非日益复杂的处理流程。我们希望这能鼓励更多朝这一方向开展的研究。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0148",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9e38317e7a62111f",
      "translationZh": "定性示例",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0149",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "33fd3004bdb03894",
      "translationZh": "Falcon OCR 可处理在严苛的真实环境条件下拍摄的图像，这些图像具有不同的光照条件、多样的文本语义内容（数学公式、结构化表格、手写笔记）以及复杂的文档布局，并生成结构化文本输出。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0150",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "70e73facbbbc7b27",
      "translationZh": "点击下方各类别以展开。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0151",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3b96da9cba517597",
      "translationZh": "手写文本与真实场景图像：准确转录手写文本及在不利条件下拍摄的真实场景图像中的文字。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0152",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "274dd7eae41a53db",
      "translationZh": "Falcon OCR 可从光照、朝向和内容复杂程度各异的手写文档及真实场景照片中提取文本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0153",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6c1c80fea1778d14",
      "translationZh": "表格提取：忠实还原各种格式的表格结构和单元格内容。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0154",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c6e724bb8cf7ae7a",
      "translationZh": "Falcon OCR 可准确还原不同格式和复杂程度的表格中的单元格内容及结构布局。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0155",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6d07ab93c297ed1b",
      "translationZh": "数学公式：准确识别符号复杂程度各异的方程。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0156",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b0ecbdef6204411c",
      "translationZh": "Falcon OCR 可正确转录数学表达式，涵盖从简单方程到包含嵌套运算符的多行推导。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0157",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dfe4563168354d30",
      "translationZh": "复杂文档版式：从多栏、混合内容文档中忠实提取文本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0158",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a5c73a42ffbf4e59",
      "translationZh": "Falcon OCR 从包含多栏布局、插图和脚注的文档中提取文本时，能够保持阅读顺序和结构保真度。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0159",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "873876cc0ac3b75a",
      "translationZh": "推理：快速、实用且开放",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0160",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "959117e4d01e8bbb",
      "translationZh": "此次发布包含一个基于 PyTorch 的 FlexAttention 构建的推理栈，使自定义注意力模式的表达切实可行，并能高效处理打包的变长序列。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0161",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2dbe85ea612e445d",
      "translationZh": "分页推理引擎",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0162",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "84190221ed0673f9",
      "translationZh": "采用虚拟页表的分页 KV 缓存（不会因填充而浪费内存）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0163",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2a3d99d3ed7bfba0",
      "translationZh": "连续批处理：新序列可在生成过程中加入，已完成的序列立即释放页面",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0164",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bb12837a749e296f",
      "translationZh": "对解码循环进行 CUDA 图捕获",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0165",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "15e650bef1007d07",
      "translationZh": "后台词元化与 GPU 计算重叠进行",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0166",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e1bf0b67c408d607",
      "translationZh": "HR 特征缓存：采用带有锁页内存缓冲区的 LRU 缓存，用于对上采样后的图像特征进行异步 GPU-CPU 传输——后续针对同一图像的查询可跳过开销高昂的上采样步骤",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0167",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9fc373908399be85",
      "translationZh": "在我们使用 H100 的配置下，对于少量实例，典型延迟约为：预填充 ~100ms、上采样 ~200ms（若已缓存则为 0ms），解码 ~50ms。（这些数值取决于分辨率、序列长度以及预测实例的数量。）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0168",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "bdbea4347ebaa39d",
      "translationZh": "Falcon-OCR 的 Docker 与 MLX 集成",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0169",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8203016b8d1062ee",
      "translationZh": "对于 Falcon-OCR 模型，我们还提供用于快速部署的 vLLM docker 服务器，以及面向 Apple-Silicon 的 MLX 集成",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0170",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7c94c23c89294f03",
      "translationZh": "详情请查看 github 仓库。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0171",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "eb25100da18e1100",
      "translationZh": "更宏观的视角：感知领域的“苦涩教训”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0172",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2ca4086f85c918cc",
      "translationZh": "Falcon Perception 有意采用极简设计：一个骨干网络、一类目标函数，仅在输出为连续且稠密的情况下使用小型预测头。其基本假设是，大部分提升应来自数据、算力和训练信号，而不是通过专用模块不断扩充处理流水线。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0173",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f8dff7a9d6e6c1b3",
      "translationZh": "这种架构不会阻碍任何显而易见的扩展路径：增加图像数量并采用更难的提示，以提升视觉定位能力；混入纯文本数据，以提升语言能力；增加上下文长度，以应对更密集的场景。它依然只是一个序列模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0174",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2c68ff46ad57de04",
      "translationZh": "Falcon Perception 由位于阿联酋阿布扎比的技术创新研究院（TII）的 Falcon Vision Team 开发。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0175",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2955789aa4f8eb36",
      "translationZh": "引用",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0176",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5faf847a02fb2793",
      "translationZh": "如果您使用 Falcon-Perception，请引用",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
  "wordWise": [
    {
      "term": "early-fusion Transformer",
      "briefZh": "早期融合架构",
      "explanationZh": "在处理的早期阶段就将图像和文本放入同一序列进行联合建模的 Transformer。"
    },
    {
      "term": "open-vocabulary grounding",
      "briefZh": "开放词汇定位",
      "explanationZh": "根据自然语言描述定位图像中的对应对象，而不局限于预先固定的类别词表。"
    },
    {
      "term": "hybrid attention mask",
      "briefZh": "混合注意力掩码",
      "explanationZh": "用于在同一序列内组合不同注意力可见性规则的掩码。"
    },
    {
      "term": "presence calibration",
      "briefZh": "存在性校准",
      "explanationZh": "校准模型对目标是否存在的判断，使其预测置信度与实际情况相符。"
    },
    {
      "term": "OCR-guided disambiguation",
      "briefZh": "文字识别引导消歧",
      "explanationZh": "利用 OCR 识别出的文字信息，区分可能混淆的目标或指代。"
    },
    {
      "term": "output heads",
      "briefZh": "输出头",
      "explanationZh": "连接在主干网络之后，将内部特征转换为具体任务预测结果的模块。"
    },
    {
      "term": "throughput",
      "briefZh": "吞吐量",
      "explanationZh": "模型在单位时间内能够处理的数据量或任务数量。"
    },
    {
      "term": "vision backbone",
      "briefZh": "视觉骨干网络",
      "explanationZh": "视觉系统中负责从图像提取基础特征的核心网络。"
    },
    {
      "term": "autoregressive",
      "briefZh": "自回归",
      "explanationZh": "根据序列中已有的内容，依次预测后续输出的方式。"
    },
    {
      "term": "image patches",
      "briefZh": "图像块",
      "explanationZh": "将图像划分得到的小块，作为模型处理视觉信息的基本输入单元。"
    },
    {
      "term": "Fourier features",
      "briefZh": "傅里叶特征",
      "explanationZh": "利用傅里叶形式编码数值的特征；此处用于将解码后的边界框坐标和尺寸重新注入模型。"
    },
    {
      "term": "segmentation masks",
      "briefZh": "分割掩码",
      "explanationZh": "在像素层面标示对象所属区域的输出。"
    },
    {
      "term": "late-fusion decoder",
      "briefZh": "晚期融合解码器",
      "explanationZh": "在视觉等信息经过独立处理后，再于较后阶段进行融合的解码器。"
    },
    {
      "term": "coarse-to-fine supervision",
      "briefZh": "由粗到细监督",
      "explanationZh": "从较粗粒度到更精细的预测层级逐步提供训练监督。"
    },
    {
      "term": "Dense perception",
      "briefZh": "密集感知",
      "explanationZh": "对图像中多个对象或细粒度空间信息进行预测的感知任务，输出规模可能随实例数量变化。"
    },
    {
      "term": "Autoregressive generation",
      "briefZh": "自回归生成",
      "explanationZh": "根据此前已生成的内容，按顺序逐步生成后续输出的方式。"
    },
    {
      "term": "embedding",
      "briefZh": "嵌入向量",
      "explanationZh": "承载信息的向量表示，此处与图像特征做点积以生成掩码。"
    },
    {
      "term": "upsampled image features",
      "briefZh": "上采样图像特征",
      "explanationZh": "经上采样提高空间分辨率的图像特征，用于生成更精细的空间输出。"
    },
    {
      "term": "binary mask",
      "briefZh": "二值掩码",
      "explanationZh": "每个像素只有两种取值的掩码，用于表示像素是否属于目标实例。"
    },
    {
      "term": "backbone",
      "briefZh": "骨干网络",
      "explanationZh": "模型中负责提取基础特征的主体网络，此处由不同输出类型共享。"
    },
    {
      "term": "lightweight heads",
      "briefZh": "轻量级输出头",
      "explanationZh": "连接到主体网络、针对特定输出进行预测且额外开销较小的模块。"
    },
    {
      "term": "Fourier feature encoding",
      "briefZh": "傅里叶特征编码",
      "explanationZh": "通过正弦特征将连续坐标映射到高维空间的编码方式。"
    },
    {
      "term": "spectral bias",
      "briefZh": "频谱偏置",
      "explanationZh": "神经网络倾向于优先学习低频变化、较难学习高频细节的特性。"
    },
    {
      "term": "discrete binning",
      "briefZh": "离散分箱",
      "explanationZh": "将连续数值划分到有限个离散区间中的表示方法。"
    }
  ],
